 "arcs": {
  "_how": "Beats in story order. needs = material role required (any = any image/clip, none = text only, brief:<field> = needs that brief field). per = 'feature' repeats the beat for each brief feature (max 4). energy 0–3 drives the generated music. role names the beat for the crew.",
